    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KELLY ESTATES are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful apartment in *** IMMACULATE CONDITION THROUGHOUT *** Situated in a very popular and well located development enjoying panoramic views of the Dublin mountains. Number 7 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout with a turn key finish.\r\n\r\nAn ideal opportunity for a wonderful 1st floor 2 bedroom apartment in a fantastic location situated in the mature Russell Crescent development with numerous amenities nearby and forms part of a beautifully designed and well balanced development that includes a mix of two, three and four bedroom houses in a well established residential area.\r\n\r\nThis apartment briefly comprises of an own door entrance with stairs to living room/kitchen, two double bedrooms and family bathroom. Many additional benefits include double glazed windows, gas fired central heating, balcony, and parking to name but a few.\r\n\r\nConveniently and centrally located off Fortunestown Way adjacent to local Schools, The Leisure Centre, Citywest & The Square Shopping Centres, Tallaght Hospital etc., Public transport options include the Cheeverstown Luas stop which is only a 15 Minute walk away, the 27 & 65b bus routes, M50 exit10 is only 10-minutes away. No. 7 is an ideal opportunity for a keen first time buyer to take that step onto the property ladder.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Fully renovated kitchen/living space (2021)\r\nRecently renovated and upgraded ( kitchen, bathroom, flooring etc) \r\nLarge attic space \r\nSouth East facing kitchen with a mountain view\r\nFeatures several bespoke custom furnishings\r\nDedicated motorbike space with ground anchor\r\nMoments from good transport links\r\nOwn door apartment \r\nService Fee: €492 per year which includes property insurance, estate maintenance, hedge trimming & weeding"
      },
      {
